          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "# MVP: Question-Answering Service over PDF Books and Markdown Files",
          "order_index": 0,
          "source_start_offset": 0,
          "source_end_offset": 67,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "## 1. Problem",
          "order_index": 1,
          "source_start_offset": 69,
          "source_end_offset": 82,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Users often have collections of technical books, manuals, notes, and internal documents in PDF and Markdown formats, but these materials are difficult to query as a single knowledge source.",
          "order_index": 2,
          "source_start_offset": 84,
          "source_end_offset": 273,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Basic file search or keyword search is often not enough because it does not reliably provide:",
          "order_index": 3,
          "source_start_offset": 275,
          "source_end_offset": 368,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "- grounded answers based on the uploaded corpus\n- references back to the relevant source material\n- synthesis across multiple files",
          "order_index": 4,
          "source_start_offset": 370,
          "source_end_offset": 501,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "## 2. Goal",
          "order_index": 5,
          "source_start_offset": 503,
          "source_end_offset": 513,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Build a service where a user can:",
          "order_index": 6,
          "source_start_offset": 515,
          "source_end_offset": 548,
          "meta": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "- upload a focused collection of PDF books and Markdown files\n- ask natural-language questions over the whole collection\n- inspect which documents, pages, chapters, or sections informed the answer",
          "order_index": 7,
          "source_start_offset": 550,
          "source_end_offset": 746,
          "meta": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
